# The Emissary San d'Oria 2 at the Chateau d'Oraguille with ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1, no Halver spell and no cipher.
# Halver at status 0: a message, no event. Status 8: 503 (parameter 7 is 1), whose finish moves to status 9 and gives
# Halver's cipher. Statuses 9 and 10: a message; status 11: nothing from the mission.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/503 HorlaisPeak/onEventFinish/32001 NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Shakir/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/545
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=2,0.1,0.1 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissarySandoria2 current
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1
login
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 8
trigger Halver
finish
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 10
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 11
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
